<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This macro is setup to autoclick the spinwheel on Keyran's website in case you have nothing better to do. Sometimes I get bored and like to farm points if I can, well before I bought a licence anyway lol. This macro is used on 1920px1080p at 400 DPI. Not sure if this is allowed? If it's not timed right anymore, it's pretty easy to adjust.</Description>
    <Comment>OSIRISSOFTWARE - SLSK - GSO</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
